  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start Ready Risk Pool Madagascar Cyclone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparedness, Anticipation project for Cyclone season in Atsimo-Andrefana, Androy, Atsinanana, Fitovinany regions Madagascar. Part of Start Ready Risk Pool 4.  Activities include: Training/capacity building for ACF emergency teams in the country. Support and/or participation in various coordination bodies at national and regional level to improve anticipatory actions and early responses. Pre-positioning of anticipation and early response kits. Pre-deployment of a response team (to be replaced by the purchase of a pre-positioning kit if the event does not occur).</narrative>
  </description>
